        "items": [
          {
            "ar": "أَعْرِضْ",
            "en": "and turn away",
            "ref": "6:106",
            "verse": "ٱتَّبِعْ مَآ أُوحِىَ إِلَيْكَ مِن رَّبِّكَ ۖ لَآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ ۖ وَأَعْرِضْ عَنِ ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ",
            "verseEn": "Follow, [O Muḥammad], what has been revealed to you from your Lord - there is no deity except Him - and turn away from those who associate others with Allāh."
          },
