            "ar": "تَوَلَّىٰ",
            "en": "turned away",
            "ref": "53:33",
            "verse": "أَفَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى تَوَلَّىٰ",
            "verseEn": "Have you seen the one who turned away"
          },
          {
            "ar": "صَدُّوا",
            "en": "and hindered",
            "ref": "16:88",
            "verse": "ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ وَصَدُّوا۟ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ زِدْنَـٰهُمْ عَذَابًۭا فَوْقَ ٱلْعَذَابِ بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يُفْسِدُونَ",
            "verseEn": "Those who disbelieved and averted [others] from the way of Allāh - We will increase them in punishment over [their] punishment for what corruption they were causing."
