            "en": "and returned",
            "ref": "7:119",
            "verse": "فَغُلِبُوا۟ هُنَالِكَ وَٱنقَلَبُوا۟ صَـٰغِرِينَ",
            "verseEn": "And they [i.e., Pharaoh and his people] were overcome right there and became debased."
          }
        ]
      },
